# PRD sync

When your edits change **user-observable flows**, **events**, **storage keys**, **background message types**, or **manifest** behavior described in **[PRD.md](../../PRD.md)**:

1. **Read** the skill **[`../skills/sync-prd/SKILL.md`](../skills/sync-prd/SKILL.md)** and follow it.
2. Update **PRD.md** in the **same change** so architecture, pseudo-code, and tables stay accurate.

Do not use PRD as release notes; **ENHANCEMENTS.md** / **popupChangelog** stay the changelog (see enhancements rule).
